        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 57,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だろ？　この調子で、ARROW・Bの\n他の曲も練習して上げてみようかな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋山 隼人"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_e:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 57,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "オレも負けてらんないっすね！\nなんかバズる動画考えないと。ん～～……はっ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊瀬谷 四季"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_e:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 57,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "『四季っちの着回しコーデ術』とか『流行りの\nコンビニスイーツ食べてみた』とか、どうっすか！？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊瀬谷 四季"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_e:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 57,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いいじゃん、オレも乗った！\n美味しいドーナツ屋巡りの回も追加で！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "若里 春名"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_e:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 57,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ハヤト、春名さん、四季くん…今はレッスン中です。\n自分たちの曲の練習に集中してください。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "冬美 旬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_e:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 57,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ほら、ナツキはもうチューニングも終えてますよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "冬美 旬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_e:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 57,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "なあ、ナツキも好きなこととか日課とか、\nなんか動画にしてみない？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "若里 春名"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_e:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 57,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "日課……。好きなこと……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "榊 夏来"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_e:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 57,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……なんでこっちを見るんだよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "冬美 旬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
